## Development versioning (mandatory)

**Canonical full label (five segments, two digits each):** **`vPM.Pn.TT.DD.SS`**

| Segments | Meaning |
|----------|---------|
| **PM** | **Prod major** (`00` until first prod-channel ship) |
| **Pn** | **Prod minor** — optional slight / patch bumps on the **same** prod major (`01.01` → `01.02`). When **PM** increments, **Pn MUST reset to `00`** (`01.xx` → `02.00`, not `02.xx`, unless Council documents an exception). |
| **TT** | Test track |
| **DD** | Demo track |
| **SS** | Showcase track |

**Rules**

1. **Bump the segment** for the **stage you are shipping** (see `minidapp_version.md` for on-chain scope per stage). Leave other segments unchanged unless Council orders a promotion reset (log in `CHANGELOG` + `minidapp_version_log.md`).
2. **Showcase** line: advance **SS** while **`PM.Pn.TT.DD`** stay **`00`** (e.g. **`v00.00.00.00.03`**). **Demo** line: advance **DD** for demo ships (e.g. first demo **`v00.00.00.01.00`**).
3. **Legacy forms** remain valid **only while prod is unused:** four-segment **`v00.00.00.03`** ≡ five-segment **`v00.00.00.00.03`**; short **`v00.00.03`** = same. Once **PM** or **Pn** is non-zero, use the **five-segment** spelling in new docs, zips, and `dapp.conf` / release notes.
4. **Authoritative detail and examples:** `0_handshake/minidapp_version.md`. **Governance mirror:** `0_handshake/handshake.md` (MiniDapp Versioning Policy).

**Current pointers** (edit in **`minidapp_version.md`** when bumping): **Showcase** — **`dapp/`** (**`stream_1_app/dapp/`**), **v00.00.03** / **v00.00.00.00.03**, **`APP_STAGE` showcase**. **Demo** — `dapp/2-demo`, **v00.00.00.01.00**, **`APP_STAGE` demo**.

**Protocol economics / mint / burn / xMinima / fees / treasury / protocol comms:** run **handshake Step 0b** before answering: read `0_handshake/protocol_mechanics_spec.md` then `stables_master_reference.md` §14. If any text conflicts, **`protocol_mechanics_spec.md` wins**; note the conflict for review.

**X (Twitter) or any Stables social templates:** apply **`0_handshake/handshake.md` §4** (*Community Communication Rules*). **Mandatory hashtag base on every X post:** `#BYB #Stablecoin #Minima`; add `#BeYourBank` / `#Stables` if space (280 char limit). **No hashtags** in Telegram community posts. **No em dash (—)** in public copy.

Confirm calibration by stating:
> "Calibration Active: Working on the basis of the Unified Handshake."  
> Add if Step 0c was read this session: *"StablesAgent KB loaded (prod `llms.txt`)."*

**Never start work without this confirmation.**

